    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if i can't make it right? i keep thinking about it and it just feels like the damage is permanent. it's not just a mistake, it's who i am. how can anyone actually look at me and see someone worth being around? it feels like i'm just a burden to everyone i touch.",
